Thanks for your order, <%= @order.first_name.presence || "friend" %>!

We've received your order and it's now being processed.
Order number: <%= @order.number %>

ITEMS
<% @order.order_items.each do |item| -%>
- <%= item.product_name %> x<%= item.quantity %>  —  <%= number_to_currency item.line_total %>
<% end -%>

Subtotal: <%= number_to_currency @order.subtotal %>
Shipping: <%= @order.shipping.zero? ? "Free" : number_to_currency(@order.shipping) %>
Total:    <%= number_to_currency @order.total %>

SHIPPING TO
<%= @order.customer_name %>
<%= @order.address %>
<%= [ @order.city, @order.postal_code, @order.country ].compact_blank.join(", ") %>

View your order: <%= order_url(@order) %>
Track it anytime at <%= track_url %> using your order number and email.

